Z||000000||Jaygee79||04-22-2001||11:52 AM||||I posted this to the Pride List but if anyone else is interested email me.<P>------------------------------<P>Now that NEFA has a logo, we would like to start printing some T-shirts.  We <BR>are going to try to have some ready for Carlisle.  Advanced orders and <BR>payments will need to be taken to cover the cost of printing.  There is not a <BR>set price yet, but the cost should probably be somewhere around $12.  If you <BR>are interested in buying a shirt, please let me know.  I will post again as <BR>soon as all the details are set.  Right now I'm just trying to get an idea of <BR>how many shirts we will need to order. <P><BR>Jaime Garman <BR><I>New England Fiero Association</I> <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A>  <P>------------------<BR>Jaime<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pooheey1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
